'How to use BraTipsters':[
  {heading:'1. Find a match',paragraphs:['Open Matches to browse today\u2019s and upcoming fixtures across supported leagues. Use the league and date filters to narrow things down, then tap a fixture to open its Match Centre.','Inside Match Centre you can inspect team form, head-to-head history, league standings, live/latest odds and available statistics before deciding anything.'],items:['League & date filters — narrow fixtures fast','Live scores for matches already underway','Odds shown per market, updated as prices move']},
