'Frequently Asked Questions':[{heading:'Are BraTipsters tips guaranteed?',paragraphs:['No. Football is unpredictable and no tip is guaranteed. Past performance does not guarantee future results.']},{heading:'How are tipster results tracked?',paragraphs:['Published predictions are settled against available match results and recorded as Won, Lost or Void when the result can be determined reliably.']},{heading:'What is a void prediction?',paragraphs:['A prediction can be void when the market cannot be settled reliably from the available result information or when the relevant outcome is ambiguous.']},{heading:'How does Premium work?',paragraphs:['Premium is a subscription service processed through Stripe. Your account receives access according to the active plan and subscription status.']},{heading:'Can I follow a tipster?',paragraphs:['Yes. Signed-in users can follow approved tipsters and receive supported notifications when new tips are published.']},{heading:'Can I become a tipster?',paragraphs:['Yes. Use Become a Tipster to submit an application. Applications are reviewed before tipster access is activated.']}],
