'Betting Guides':[{heading:'Core football markets',items:['Match result: Home, Draw or Away.','Double Chance: 1X, X2 or 12.','Both Teams To Score (BTTS).','Over/Under goals, including Over 2.5.','Corners and other supported markets.']},{heading:'Reading odds',paragraphs:['Odds express the price attached to an outcome. Compare the odds with your own assessment of probability and remember that higher odds generally imply lower market probability, not a better bet.']},{heading:'Research before deciding',paragraphs:['Use form, H2H, xGoals, standings, gameplay statistics and price movement as context rather than as guarantees.']}],
